@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ito-il03-nouns`

-- Income Tax Ordinance [New Version], s 121B — additional tax on high incomes, IN TAX YEAR 2025
-- (BACKLOG IL-31, part B). The vintage that Act SH 3342 (amendment 276, 26 December 2024,
-- p. 150; ../../registers/source-bundle/amending-laws/25_lsr_5396578.pdf, sha256 1f33320a...25e70)
-- made, from the day it commenced.
--
-- WHAT THE ACT DOES TO s 121B (its s 1(2); page image, checked against the PDF text layer):
--   i.   deletes from subsection (a) the parenthesis that defined "taxable income chargeable to
--        additional tax";
--   ii.  inserts (a1): a further 2% on the part of the capital-source taxable income above the
--        amount in (a);
--   iii. in (b), after the words naming the income chargeable to additional tax, inserts
--        "under subsections (a) or (a1)";
--   iv.  in (e): the lead-in is punctuated for a list of definitions; in the definition of taxable income, the
--        amount is 5,385,285 shekels and the base index is the one published on 15 January
--        2027; and a new definition, "הכנסה חייבת ממקור הוני", is added.
-- Its s 3(a): the Act commences on 1 January 2025. Its s 3(b) (quoted below): s 121B(a1)
-- applies to income produced OR received from the commencement day.
--
-- WHICH TAX YEAR THIS MODULE ANSWERS: 2025, and only 2025. A tax year is a calendar year, so
-- tax year 2025 begins on the commencement day and every item of it was produced or received on
-- or after that day. For 2024 and earlier the section's text before the Act is not deposited,
-- and (a1) reaches income of an earlier year that was RECEIVED from 1 January 2025, which the
-- text does not allocate to a tax year: declined by name. From 2026 the text is row IL-03's.
--
-- WHAT IS NOT HERE. The (a) amount for 2025 is an income ceiling that s 120B fixes at its
-- 1 January 2024 figure after rounding (s 120B(e)(1), added by the same Act's s 1(1)); the
-- rounding Order is not deposited, so the caller supplies the figure, as in row IL-03. A
-- residential-apartment sale is answered, because the Act itself prints the threshold.
--
-- The forks F9, F10, F11, F14, F15 of row IL-03 are read here as IL-03 reads them (NOTES.md
-- section 4): the exemption condition belongs to the residential limb alone; the threshold is
-- the case's tax year's; "ממקורות הוניים" is the defined term; "exceeds" is strict;
-- betterment is capital-source income.
--
-- NAMES. Row IL-03's module for the same section defines helpers with the same words. Every
-- helper here carries the prefix "SH 3342 text — ", so that one module can import both and send
-- tax year 2025 here and every later year there (NOTES.md section 9); the entry point's own name
-- ("... in tax year 2025 for") already differs.
--
-- `-- src:N |` quotes line N of the consolidation; `-- act:` quotes the Act.

§ `Section 121B in tax year 2025`

§§ `Commencement and application`

-- act: SH 3342 s 3(a) | תחילתו של חוק זה ביום א׳ בטבת התשפ״ה (1 בינואר 2025) (להלן – יום התחילה)
-- act: SH 3342 s 3(b) | סעיף 121ב(א1) לפקודה, כנוסחו בחוק זה, יחול על הכנסה שהופקה או התקבלה ביום התחילה ואילך
@ref Act SH 3342 s 3(b); section 121B(a1), source line 4457
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 121B(a1) applies to income produced or received on` `the day` MEANS
    `the day` AT LEAST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2025)

@ref Act SH 3342 s 3(a); the section's amendment list, source line 4455
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the tax year in which Act SH 3342 commenced` MEANS 2025

@ref Act SH 3342 s 3
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 121B for a tax year before 2025 needs a source` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 121B for a tax year before 2025 needs a source: its text before Act SH 3342 (amendment 276), which the Act amends by words and which is not deposited, and the Act does not say to which tax year income produced earlier but received from 1 January 2025 belongs"

@ref Act SH 3342; row IL-03
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 121B from tax year 2026 is answered by row IL-03, not by this vintage` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 121B from tax year 2026 is answered by row IL-03, not by the tax year 2025 vintage of row IL-31"

§§ `121B(e) — the residential-apartment threshold, in tax year 2025`

-- act: SH 3342 s 1(2)(ה)(2) | בהגדרה ״הכנסה חייבת״, במקום הסכום הנקוב בה יבוא ״5,385,285 שקלים חדשים״
-- src:4462 | ”הכנסה חייבת“ – הכנסה חייבת כהגדרתה בסעיף 1 וכמשמעותה בסעיף 89, למעט סכום אינפלציוני כהגדרתו בסעיף 88 וסכום אינפלציוני כהגדרתו בסעיף 47 לחוק מיסוי מקרקעין, ולרבות שבח כמשמעותו בחוק מיסוי מקרקעין, ואולם לגבי מכירת זכות במקרקעין בדירת מגורים כהגדרתה בחוק האמור – רק אם שווי מכירתה עולה על 5,385,285 שקלים חדשים [note: (נקוב לשנת 2025; בשנת 2026, 5,385,285 ש״ח)] והמכירה אינה פטורה ממס לפי כל דין; הסכום האמור יתואם בהתאם להוראות סעיף 9(ג2) לחוק מיסוי מקרקעין, ולעניין זה יהיה המדד הבסיסי כאמור באותו סעיף המדד שפורסם ביום המדד שפורסם ביום ז׳ בשבט התשפ״ז (15 בינואר 2027);
-- In 2025 the figure is the one the Act prints. The adjustment s 121B(e) borrows from s 9(c2) of
-- the Real Estate Taxation Law is made "in every tax year, except in the tax years 2025 to 2027"
-- (Act SH 3342 s 2(1)(ג)(1); the deposited consolidation of that Law, line 239 of
-- ../../../real-estate-taxation-law-5723-1963/registers/source-bundle/real-estate-taxation-law-5723-1963.he.wiki.txt),
-- by the rise since a base index published on 15 January 2027 (the same file, line 247), so
-- none can fall in 2025.
@ref Act SH 3342 s 1(2)(ה)(2); source line 4462
GIVEN `the tax year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`SH 3342 text — the residential-apartment sale value in section 121B(e) for tax year` `the tax year` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the tax year` LESS THAN 2025 THEN `section 121B for a tax year before 2025 needs a source`
           IF `the tax year` GREATER THAN 2025 THEN `section 121B from tax year 2026 is answered by row IL-03, not by this vintage`
           OTHERWISE 5_385_285

§§ `121B(e) — taxable income, and taxable income from a capital source`

-- Excluding the inflationary amount of s 88 from an item.
@ref source line 4462
GIVEN `the item` IS AN `An item of income`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`SH 3342 text — the taxable income for section 121B in` `the item` MEANS
    `the item`'s `amount` MINUS `the item`'s `inflationary amount, as defined in section 88`

-- Betterment counts, except that for a residential apartment it counts only if the sale value
-- EXCEEDS the threshold and the sale is not exempt from tax under any law (fork F9, F14).
@ref source line 4462
GIVEN `the sale`     IS A `A sale of a right in real estate`
      `the tax year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`SH 3342 text — the betterment on` `the sale` `counts for section 121B in tax year` `the tax year` MEANS
       NOT `the sale`'s `in a residential apartment`
    OR (    `the sale`'s `sale value` GREATER THAN `SH 3342 text — the residential-apartment sale value in section 121B(e) for tax year` `the tax year`
        AND NOT `the sale`'s `exempt from tax under any law`)

-- Counted net of its s 47 inflationary amount; a sale that does not count contributes nothing.
@ref source line 4462
GIVEN `the sale`     IS A `A sale of a right in real estate`
      `the tax year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`SH 3342 text — the taxable income for section 121B from` `the sale` `in tax year` `the tax year` MEANS
    IF   `SH 3342 text — the betterment on` `the sale` `counts for section 121B in tax year` `the tax year`
    THEN `the sale`'s `betterment` MINUS `the sale`'s `inflationary amount, as defined in section 47 of the Real Estate Taxation Law`
    ELSE 0

@ref source line 4462
GIVEN `the individual` IS AN `An individual in a tax year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`SH 3342 text — the taxable income for section 121B of` `the individual` MEANS
         sum (map (GIVEN i YIELD `SH 3342 text — the taxable income for section 121B in` i) (`the individual`'s `items of income`))
    PLUS sum (map (GIVEN s YIELD `SH 3342 text — the taxable income for section 121B from` s `in tax year` (`the individual`'s `tax year`)) (`the individual`'s `sales of rights in real estate`))

-- act: SH 3342 s 1(2)(ה)(3) | ״הכנסה חייבת ממקור הוני״ – הכנסה חייבת, למעט כל אחת מאלה
-- act: SH 3342 s 1(2)(ה)(3) | הכנסה לפי סעיף 2(1) או (2)
-- act: SH 3342 s 1(2)(ה)(3) | הכנסה מיגיעה אישית שאינה הכנסה כאמור בפסקה (1)
-- src:4463 | ”הכנסה חייבת ממקור הוני“ – הכנסה חייבת, למעט כל אחת מאלה:
-- src:4464 | (1) הכנסה לפי סעיף 2(1) או (2);
-- src:4465 | (2) הכנסה מיגיעה אישית שאינה הכנסה כאמור בפסקה (1).
@ref Act SH 3342 s 1(2)(ה)(3); source lines 4463-4465
GIVEN `the item` IS AN `An item of income`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`SH 3342 text — from a capital source` `the item` MEANS
    NOT (   "(1)" ... `the item`'s `under section 2(1) or 2(2)`
         OR "(2)" ... `the item`'s `from personal exertion`)

-- Betterment is neither s 2(1)/(2) income nor income from personal exertion, so every counted
-- betterment is capital-source income (fork F15 of IL-03).
@ref source lines 4463-4465
GIVEN `the individual` IS AN `An individual in a tax year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`SH 3342 text — the taxable income from a capital source for section 121B of` `the individual` MEANS
         sum (map (GIVEN i YIELD `SH 3342 text — the taxable income for section 121B in` i)
                  (filter (GIVEN i YIELD `SH 3342 text — from a capital source` i) (`the individual`'s `items of income`)))
    PLUS sum (map (GIVEN s YIELD `SH 3342 text — the taxable income for section 121B from` s `in tax year` (`the individual`'s `tax year`)) (`the individual`'s `sales of rights in real estate`))

§§ `121B(a) and (a1) — the two charges`

-- src:4456 | (א) יחיד אשר הכנסתו החייבת בשנת המס עלתה על 640,000 שקלים חדשים [note: (נקוב לשנת 2017; בשנת 2023, 698,280 ש״ח; בשנים 2024–2027, 721,560 ש״ח)], יהיה חייב במס נוסף על חלק הכנסתו החייבת העולה על 640,000 שקלים חדשים [note: (נקוב לשנת 2017; ראו לעיל)], בשיעור של 3%.
@ref source line 4456
GIVEN `the taxable income` IS A NUMBER
      `the amount`         IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`SH 3342 text — s 121B(a) — the additional tax on` `the taxable income` `above` `the amount` MEANS
    IF   `the taxable income` GREATER THAN `the amount`
    THEN 3% TIMES (`the taxable income` MINUS `the amount`)
    ELSE 0

-- act: SH 3342 s 1(2)(ג) | נוסף על האמור בסעיף קטן (א), יחיד אשר הכנסתו החייבת ממקורות הוניים בשנת המס עלתה על הסכום הקבוע באותו סעיף קטן, יהיה חייב במס נוסף על חלק הכנסתו החייבת ממקורות הוניים העולה על הסכום האמור, בשיעור של 2%
-- src:4457 | (א1) נוסף על האמור בסעיף קטן (א), יחיד אשר הכנסתו החייבת ממקורות הוניים בשנת המס עלתה על הסכום הקבוע באותו סעיף קטן, יהיה חייב במס נוסף על חלק הכנסתו החייבת ממקורות הוניים העולה על הסכום האמור, בשיעור של 2%.
@ref Act SH 3342 s 1(2)(ג); source line 4457
GIVEN `the taxable income from a capital source` IS A NUMBER
      `the amount`                               IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`SH 3342 text — s 121B(a1) — the additional tax on` `the taxable income from a capital source` `above` `the amount` MEANS
    IF   `the taxable income from a capital source` GREATER THAN `the amount`
    THEN 2% TIMES (`the taxable income from a capital source` MINUS `the amount`)
    ELSE 0

-- act: SH 3342 s 1(2)(ד) | אחרי ״הכנסה החייבת במס נוסף״ יבוא ״לפי סעיפים קטנים (א) או (א1)״
-- src:4458 | (ב) על הכנסה החייבת במס נוסף לפי סעיפים קטנים (א) או (א1) לא יחולו הוראות סעיף 91(ד) לעניין מקדמות.
@ref Act SH 3342 s 1(2)(ד); source line 4458
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`SH 3342 text — s 121B(b) — section 91(d) on advance payments applies to income chargeable to additional tax under (a) or (a1)` MEANS
    FALSE

§§ `Section 121B for an individual in tax year 2025`

@ref source lines 4455-4465
GIVEN `the individual` IS AN `An individual in a tax year`
GIVETH A MAYBE `A problem with the facts, for sections 121 and 121B`
`SH 3342 text — a problem with the facts for section 121B of` `the individual` MEANS
    BRANCH IF any (GIVEN i YIELD i's `amount` LESS THAN 0) `the items`
           THEN JUST `an amount of income is negative`
           IF        any (GIVEN i YIELD i's `inflationary amount, as defined in section 88` LESS THAN 0) `the items`
                  OR any (GIVEN s YIELD s's `inflationary amount, as defined in section 47 of the Real Estate Taxation Law` LESS THAN 0) `the sales`
           THEN JUST `an inflationary amount is negative`
           IF any (GIVEN s YIELD s's `betterment` LESS THAN 0 OR s's `sale value` LESS THAN 0) `the sales`
           THEN JUST `a betterment or a sale value is negative`
           OTHERWISE NOTHING
    WHERE
        `the items` MEANS `the individual`'s `items of income`
        `the sales` MEANS `the individual`'s `sales of rights in real estate`

-- The two refusals of the year are settled first, in return position.
@ref source lines 4456-4465; Act SH 3342 s 1(2), s 3
GIVEN `the individual`                                         IS AN `An individual in a tax year`
      `the amount in section 121B(a) in force in the tax year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN EITHER `A problem with the facts, for sections 121 and 121B` NUMBER
`the additional tax under section 121B in tax year 2025 for` `the individual` `, with the amount in section 121B(a) at` `the amount in section 121B(a) in force in the tax year` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the tax year` LESS THAN 2025
           THEN `section 121B for a tax year before 2025 needs a source`
           IF `the tax year` GREATER THAN 2025
           THEN `section 121B from tax year 2026 is answered by row IL-03, not by this vintage`
           OTHERWISE
               CONSIDER `SH 3342 text — a problem with the facts for section 121B of` `the individual`
               WHEN JUST `the problem` THEN LEFT `the problem`
               WHEN NOTHING            THEN RIGHT (`under (a)` PLUS `under (a1)`)
    WHERE
        `the tax year` MEANS `the individual`'s `tax year`
        `the amount`   MEANS `the amount in section 121B(a) in force in the tax year`
        `under (a)`    MEANS `SH 3342 text — s 121B(a) — the additional tax on` (`SH 3342 text — the taxable income for section 121B of` `the individual`) `above` `the amount`
        `under (a1)`   MEANS `SH 3342 text — s 121B(a1) — the additional tax on` (`SH 3342 text — the taxable income from a capital source for section 121B of` `the individual`) `above` `the amount`
